usage: aiopsctl plugin disable <row> [--profile <p>] [--connect-wait <duration>] [--wait <duration>]

Disable a row in a profile of the home.

Flags:
  --profile <p>              the profile to change (default: the one that run/status.json of the home names)
  --connect-wait <duration>  how long to try the socket of a running process (default: 60s)
  --wait <duration>          how long to wait for the final result (default: 10m)

Exit codes:
  0  success, or help that was asked for
  1  a denial, a failed step, rebuild-required, an interrupt or a failed boot; the reason is on stderr
  2  a usage error; a Go panic outside every fiber also exits 2, with the trace of the runtime
